                <label for="pnStockQty">재고수량<span class="pn-lock" id="pnLockStockQty" hidden title="다음 자동 적재가 이 값을 덮지 않습니다">잠김</span></label>
                <div class="pn-num-wrap"><input id="pnStockQty" class="pn-input" type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="1" data-bind="stock_qty"><span class="pn-unit">개</span></div>
                <div class="pn-fnote err" id="pnStockQtyErr" hidden></div>
